###Mapping
Mapping test::emberglacier::mapping::SkywatchMapping
(
  *test::emberglacier::domain::Observatory[obs]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::emberglacier::store::SkywatchDb]skywatch.observatory.observatory_id
    )
    ~mainTable [test::emberglacier::store::SkywatchDb]skywatch.observatory
    observatoryCode: [test::emberglacier::store::SkywatchDb]skywatch.observatory.observatory_code,
    observatoryName: [test::emberglacier::store::SkywatchDb]skywatch.observatory.observatory_name,
    elevationM: [test::emberglacier::store::SkywatchDb]skywatch.observatory.elevation_m,
